{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:2e80768e84707c5ed63a123e81bacdb89968cbcb222a4c063a29420b473715e9",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80b1a777068ada7a3c19d16a4d0ba7dec24821493eace815e937e3af5582be80",
      "text": "绿意浓郁的山野间",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d469dbef01baa482355878d7f02ddceb48ecdc6c6204b1e7ad88c020d62bdbe7",
      "text": "制作人为了增进与一希的感情，\n决定前往适合新手的露营地。\n以舒缓的步调前往目的地的途中，\n看见松鼠的一希即兴编织起故事，讲给制作人听。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_a:cmd-000011:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_a:cmd-000011:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80b1a777068ada7a3c19d16a4d0ba7dec24821493eace815e937e3af5582be80",
      "text": "绿意浓郁的山野间",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36cd4508e2a5441cf92020dd3f2164487b8d9a7e7b1935b37926145f730b16dc",
      "text": "……步伐会太快吗，\n●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0afc1a0b06dec6cd16418687cc1dad9df8fcccb6c4ed9c5ee7583cbcfa15b18",
      "text": "没事的。按这个步幅走\n既能锻炼身体，感觉也很舒服。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc11b1e03e4b34fcacf4a994b0ed0f997774a941c8d1ff424bf4e8ff1014fb02",
      "text": "……这样啊。提议选在\n这个适合新手的地点真是做对了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5cac7d6a01862a216bfde311983207b1817388d033428cc26e6df4bda5c2e60a",
      "text": "谢谢你的体贴关照。\n一希先生经常来这座山吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f331e6c543ca0e011dd6e3fed99d3d39237ae27d763591ae4d8eea7c24ecb8af",
      "text": "……嗯，因为离得近。而且，只要轻装就能\n攀登的这里，对明天的工作也不会有影响……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_a:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6cc42887ba1ae8725466ed957f9621c53611df8b024f09d376f2af1ca719071b",
      "text": "……不，工作的事就先别提了。\n今天谢谢你邀请我来露营。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_a:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ef8e131a59802ea6a51e90bdd331c010bd4390232522c26e65a5425d8d80b1f",
      "text": "好的。作为制作人，\n我也想增进和一希先生的感情。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74c057f2e940bc4a71d75c724ca78fca5dc2aaf8cb06938d7049f96958240cdb",
      "text": "……和我？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_a:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d64f813f4460048ad5230cffe55b482b41484f569bc334730721e0a0ff7e735b",
      "text": "之前听说一希先生喜欢露营，\n就想着或许能聊一些平时聊不到的话题。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_a:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0314bcf7a65d9ddbc85703c32d9437be45e144090b94fed9d3fe248be6f63ec2",
      "text": "……原来如此。虽然不知道能否回应你的期待，\n但今天就好好享受这段时光吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe343aad7bcfe8177ceba117c7566aaf43f389b1246b7acb90c58dbfd3b223aa",
      "text": "……唔。那里有只松鼠呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_b:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:664899e1da7fb05e3732909751a733277403a7c111419265575da2a05af4494d",
      "text": "啊，真的。\n嘴里塞满坚果的样子好可爱呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:152916593aedb3ee007fc5bf0fe5977341a3102cdef91ea759f27bd18011b245",
      "text": "……嗯？又来了一只松鼠。既然如此……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_b:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e83d4d5fe2f675d18084a9d8407b6963e9609b1eb957e9751e251c20240e23fb",
      "text": "……在和平中生活的松鼠王国的王子。\n然而，这份和平却突然受到了威胁。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_b:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee29a1a13a5eccd11b58c24a267859ae091f0e02211227e4e83383d2e968423e",
      "text": "……是外界松鼠们的袭来。\n它们在智力与战力上，展现出了压倒性的差距。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_b:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:539b96524fe069dcec1763a0722ea3e66d12dc5af187270363ee438e2172ad00",
      "text": "……王子为了守护王国，以小小的身躯\n拾起树枝当剑，架起果壳当盾……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a92d33f0a95bf41c5694632dac497cbd00aab23b4f5c29f608dc1b851c1b6859",
      "text": "然后呢，之后怎么样了？\n刚才的故事，我很在意后续！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_b:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e38074622bc98b44c4c9a1fee711cb17f837b923098b275ca76e0cd3889dadce",
      "text": "……这样啊。那么，\n就从王子找到最初的同伴那里开始讲起吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_b:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1e43547f70c3ab3f61395b6b611ce40e74a4ed5446f6ccff5c4bfa4b12d9a09",
      "text": "（一边攀爬着山路，一边听一希先生\n讲了许多即兴创作的故事）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_b:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bacf45a7e531ab4d570452a2f239e52fc917bb50beb37752cb2be95c6e69e632",
      "text": "（一希先生作为前小说家的想象力，\n在偶像活动中也一定能大放异彩！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_c:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cf299b9db82240fc03c5e3aeca137dae387b6b9aadfc396c17215c632e680b3",
      "text": "数十分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_c:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54d68506df03365fbb4a2c462a357f4a8d1001365bc1a320271708ce730055bb",
      "text": "这里就是露营地吗。\n被森林环绕，真是个好地方呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_c:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f4040d2ea8b2d54dc033c3ed0f9a0109d423fd28e5f30013b8dc83b593e89fe",
      "text": "……你喜欢的话，那就再好不过了。\n那么，首先来搭建帐篷吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07934d888abaa913ffa4b7b49e13b3f495e74accc4fed2cac4ae1779e889e599",
      "text": "……●●●●プロデューサー，\n能来帮我一下吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_c:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93a5a79b48bae347aa8d286205ef2ebfed60710735fd13e4bf0770665ac3733e",
      "text": "好的，当然没问题！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_c:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e5e175a329312b5d00908eac9f6467842d4e262eb087d452dd058e9d9e581cd",
      "text": "……好。这样就行了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_c:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39e40f211dd0e18848068b20036b43e31c947c28171d875b98a198ea0ba0580f",
      "text": "真不愧是一希先生。\n搭帐篷竟然这么熟练快捷。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_c:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7bd36c53a353e5a63659c5356f2b045d50807d3b975c629b7a29900a2be81959",
      "text": "……只是习惯了而已。\n不过，差不多也该休息一下了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_c:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:713ceb7b1629c6d74d0d8a735ee7816a9eb1c3636f2e0638bea2ba83c4e09e39",
      "text": "……我烧了热水。\n●●●●プロデューサー也喝可可可以吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_c:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98a6ac2730e4d94a77cc9db4064f434892c7fc22da2799c1a12c14f99b5d3583",
      "text": "好的，谢谢。\n在这里喝可可一定别有一番风味吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_c:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27449d0ae4960f3132b0400dc28aa57e12605b0c61220cc22635826c2865ffad",
      "text": "……嗯。看着星星喝的话，会更美味。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_c:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c78b6a0df74f86115b3372626c91c158365d7fc1a8f545931d7ccc0c0f5b0562",
      "text": "……来，给你。\n很烫，小心一点。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_d:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b03f4579bf49243d39b8b135c7c88acbbbec8c41605059e7ce58dde1b4bb9a5",
      "text": "……呼。可可非常好喝。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_d:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6cbf2d5f57ff21f8928162376507eb4a708b5b5d9d79e9bdc9f86dc6d6d82ec",
      "text": "……太好了。\n我带了饼干来。要吃吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_d:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb98c86b4617613033c181b3d8400a342d7bda0c5043d5be4dd2b90ec37d261d",
      "text": "……配可可很合适。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_d:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1cc66272fb0b558114a1d62cdd987a0e99cad6bd24128677c7bff995e182c4e0",
      "text": "谢谢。虽然算不上回礼……\n不过我也准备了便当哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_d:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:197e7cf5e988e0093ab5e4704e689aab51ea2d53644df4015db3cf21e524e8ff",
      "text": "……啊，你说过会带的呢。\n那我开动了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_d:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5fd7a24e0ff13b58a3d311cfc94e6cf8e9bade7c6b4fd240d1eedc058fb2f129",
      "text": "……多谢款待。很好吃。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_d:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cdcca58adb78cace2769d8a1b79e321e059af71bdfd22fd33d45c2bbd0cf4397",
      "text": "能合一希先生的胃口，太好了！\n顺便问一下，您最喜欢哪道配菜？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_d:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ad55ce26b065c877bc73b9c8d113afd8c074d8987ed1d88a966a0c39c1490f0",
      "text": "……哪道……？\n…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_d:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ce8f57522023ead05624dfa7d29c526be9a7b14d32c2cf0e608fa8d2ab30326",
      "text": "难道说，是个很难回答的问题吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_d:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:478db5c7ee165ba499cc219713d5ba8a6f58829b6604528c4d1a31aa0f8ac7cb",
      "text": "……不，抱歉。我陷入沉思了。\n无论回想起哪一道，嘴角都会自然地上扬。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_d:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afe267066a338cc6bf04b238da2617c3a0276116e374fdf8254f9c65fb27c9c0",
      "text": "……所以，答案是全部。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_e:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ab7d91ef231f7954eb9fae545ff8108d0652b8cdc76269dd374eaa76098b4af",
      "text": "说起来，\n一希先生最喜欢的食物是什么呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_e:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7de8be5642c8573ea8d98a412ba92062a92520aa5754eef359730a89948ff2d",
      "text": "……硬要说的话，是蘑菇吧。\n既美味，营养价值也很优秀。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_e:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f23b9503cef1acdf1fa9ce69285d95873af768af6d5c04e15237fca11706edf7",
      "text": "……在这附近找找的话，说不定\n也能找到能食用的蘑菇呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_e:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64c1771217b640348e286f1cea78b3832f30d199c0a4f0d41bba69b87aa6b92a",
      "text": "这样啊。那一希先生如果不介意的话，\n下次要不要来这里采蘑菇？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_e:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76db261bcc426aca862d604e8009eab7d2b272beec5d56d992a60fafa382e1d0",
      "text": "……嗯，那挺好啊。\n我也会去查查各种资料的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_e:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7616b5c12bb2d8d912ed73cff94186de664758189e15558c22c5fb9a8540b45b",
      "text": "……那么，差不多该到平时的那个了……\n●●●●プロデューサー，可以吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_e:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75b570622ad206cf387297c7756da618af0821410f81a6023f3ee01c1048243a",
      "text": "好的，是读书时间对吧。听说今天能读到一希先生推荐的\n书，我一直很期待。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_e:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8b8b6adc3b2d9a484e8f3741426b74934ccfd03c55f66686d8831cc502ee49d",
      "text": "……这次为了配合这里的氛围，\n我带了几本以森林为题材的小说。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_e:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4056173afb971c61300aea71597346f3fe50cf86c96125f76e54fdde572ae1c",
      "text": "哇，有这么多！\n非常感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_e:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3f97a0dbf35526d7b5765c3dc8caf12d00fc19f3dd08623d610968371cf3748",
      "text": "……难以精简到一本。\n请从这里面挑你感兴趣的吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_e:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ab5cd9305cf16e8288061c70b0b50c12080e1305fd4353e9b9d5943cf12966d",
      "text": "那么……我打算先读这本！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_e:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1270ea367df48c54f7747cfee4c6002b8c84af3bf2f336d142a6eaf2d7d00257",
      "text": "……是那本啊。那是我最喜欢的一本。\n读完之后，请务必跟我聊聊感想。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
